    <guid isPermaLink="false">60ec379052ea083b82c30704</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Jul 2021 12:36:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你好，欢迎收听有知有行新一期的带读。我是棒棒糖。这一期是围绕温度计展开的。每天花一点时间，多了解温度计一点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Day 10 为什么温度计可以估值：温度计的原理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a> </span><a href="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#PRVM5U" data-url="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#PRVM5U"><span>一、用「万得全A指数」代表A股市场的全貌</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FlSSXjSQzA7ySQyq78-gxNQUlWAT.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> </span><a href="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#VhkFdT" data-url="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#VhkFdT"><span>二、「全市场温度计」综合考虑 PE 和 PB</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> </span><a href="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#wrzccy" data-url="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#wrzccy"><span>三、采取「等权」的计算方式</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> </span><a href="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#d6pZ8e" data-url="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#d6pZ8e"><span>四、具体计算和数据周期选择（可略过）</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FucoVvEpHXbTR0MYMq1HYvNkq9Nh.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FqQAX809JnZ1MKlP5VcI78xnVaJE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> </span><a href="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#FtgVnH" data-url="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#FtgVnH"><span>五、此刻的市场</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> </span><a href="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#NROmfF" data-url="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#NROmfF"><span>六、为什么定投不择时</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> </span><a href="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#C8C5cd" data-url="https://nizl9m7f2r.feishu.cn/docs/doccn3Y7v3Mro7OsycOvRcO3AXf#C8C5cd"><span>七、「温度计」不是短期择时工具，而是为了「保有一种周期感」～</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【下期预告】如何看全市场温度和具体指数的温度？我们明天见～</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🦄️ &nbsp;彩蛋</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>不更新的日子里，我在更新我自己，并将一次次与自己/朋友/书本的抵足夜谈记录在我的小报童：</span><a href="https://xiaobot.net/p/twinkleaway" data-url="https://xiaobot.net/p/twinkleaway"><span>xiaobot.net</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FveoZ-GbLV5M80Gbs9jyFvOaJsPY.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
