  <item>
    <title>Day 7 最适合新手的投资方法是什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60c1b61016b571e1f744137a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">60c1b61016b571e1f744137a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 10 Jun 2021 06:48:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你好，欢迎参加有知有行带读活动，我是 azure 棒棒糖🍭。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每天花一点时间，解决一个投资中绕不过去的问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天的主题是：最合适新手的投资方式是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> 什么是定投？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">1:19</a> 有知有行对于定投的认知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">2:06</a> 「</span><a href="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/thermometer" data-url="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/thermometer"><span>股市温度计</span></a><span>」是有知有行为普通投资者开发的定投学习工具，我们的投资理念是：①</span><a href="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/n/materials/248" data-url="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/n/materials/248"><span>好资产</span></a><span> + ②</span><a href="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/n/materials/171" data-url="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/n/materials/171"><span>好价格</span></a><span> + ③</span><a href="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/n/materials/249" data-url="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/n/materials/249"><span>长期持有</span></a><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">2:18</a> 什么是好资产？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">3:34</a> 什么是好价格？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">4:16</a> 「股市温度计」定投 V.S. 普通定投（定时 + 定额）沪深300和中证500，做了一个量化回测</span></p><span></span><p><span>有知有行做了 </span><a href="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/n/materials/172" data-url="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/n/materials/172"><span>4 种不同定投策略的结果对比</span></a><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/n/materials/172" href="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/n/materials/172">youzhiyouxing.cn</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">5:13</a> 如何开始定投？</span></p><span></span><p><span>有知有行「</span><a href="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/thermometer" data-url="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/thermometer"><span>股市温度计</span></a><span>」：<a data-url="https://youzhiyouxing.cn/thermometer" href="